[{"_path":"/zh/blog/no-git-lfs","_dir":"blog","_draft":false,"_partial":false,"_locale":"","title":"不推荐对网站项目使用git lfs","description":"","date":"2025-07-14 16:22","tags":["git","tool","git-lfs"],"body":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"网站项目如react, next, vue, nuxt, 一般会包含一些图片文件, 如logo, 但是不会太多."}]},{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"使用git lfs后, 只使用git clone拉取项目到服务器, 可能会发现图片损坏."}]},{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"当然你可以尝试使用git lfs pull等命令修复, 但是在服务器上操作不如本地方便."}]},{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"我把nuxt网站项目部署到服务器, 发现图片损坏. 使用git lfs pull后, 发现访问图片已经在服务器上存在, 但通过url访问时png图片时, 获得的是一张一样宽高但完全透明的没有内容的图片."}]},{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不使用git lfs可以节约你的生命."}]}]}],"toc":{"title":"","searchDepth":2,"depth":2,"links":[]}},"_type":"markdown","_id":"content:zh:blog:979.no-git-lfs.md","_source":"content","_file":"zh/blog/979.no-git-lfs.md","_stem":"zh/blog/979.no-git-lfs","_extension":"md"}]